# Bundled ONNX model weights can be large (the ~553 MB VGG16 used only
# transiently for training is never committed, but a real pretrained
# model bundled directly into the app - like a future model larger than
# the small ones shipped so far - can exceed GitHub's 100 MB per-file
# push limit). Track them through Git LFS so that ceiling stops being a
# blocker for future models, without requiring a history rewrite of the
# small ONNX files already committed as regular blobs.
*.onnx filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text
